            <description><![CDATA[Qwen-Image-Edit]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_m6px" id="qwen-image-edit"><a href="https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/qwen-image-edit/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Qwen-Image-Edit</a><a class="hash-link" href="#qwen-image-edit" title="Direct link to heading">​</a></h2><p><img loading="lazy" alt="alt text" src="/top-project-trend/assets/images/Qwen-Image-Edit-c582e4acc8b6c5a5cdbd5bb1dc6b867d.png" width="1912" height="962" class="img_FQL_"></p><p>Qwen-Image-Edit: 全能图像编辑，驱动内容创作提质增效</p><p>地址：<a href="https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/qwen-image-edit/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://qwenlm.github.io/blog/qwen-image-edit/</a></p>]]></content:encoded>
